{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\079.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "4.2Compare two quantities by percentage", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[473, 80], [1419, 80], [1419, 139], [473, 139]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.855, "box": [[217, 138], [411, 145], [410, 185], [216, 178]]}, {"text": "Ali got 43 marks out of 50 and Madiha got 40 marks out of 50. Compare the marks", "conf": 0.938, "box": [[212, 187], [1601, 189], [1601, 245], [211, 243]]}, {"text": "obtained by using percentage.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[215, 246], [736, 259], [735, 298], [214, 285]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[215, 300], [376, 304], [375, 338], [214, 334]]}, {"text": "First find the percentage of marks Ali got.", "conf": 0.916, "box": [[214, 350], [872, 358], [872, 400], [213, 392]]}, {"text": "Total marks", "conf": 0.81, "box": [[216, 426], [402, 428], [402, 465], [215, 463]]}, {"text": "= 50", "conf": 0.625, "box": [[604, 427], [701, 427], [701, 470], [604, 470]]}, {"text": "Previous Knowledge check", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[1119, 461], [1527, 463], [1526, 497], [1119, 495]]}, {"text": "Marks obtained by Ali", "conf": 0.872, "box": [[213, 490], [572, 495], [571, 532], [212, 527]]}, {"text": "= 43", "conf": 0.767, "box": [[589, 491], [699, 491], [699, 533], [589, 533]]}, {"text": "Howcanwecomparetwo", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[1168, 527], [1502, 527], [1502, 557], [1168, 557]]}, {"text": "43", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[656, 554], [706, 554], [706, 589], [656, 589]]}, {"text": "Marks obtained by Ali", "conf": 0.848, "box": [[211, 573], [569, 575], [569, 615], [210, 613]]}, {"text": "× 100%", "conf": 0.756, "box": [[715, 575], [836, 572], [837, 609], [716, 612]]}, {"text": "quantities?", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[1166, 567], [1310, 563], [1311, 594], [1167, 599]]}, {"text": "150", "conf": 0.725, "box": [[643, 589], [709, 586], [711, 629], [645, 632]]}, {"text": "IfAlihasRs459andAhmad", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[1166, 603], [1529, 603], [1529, 632], [1166, 632]]}, {"text": "= 86%", "conf": 0.796, "box": [[601, 647], [724, 647], [724, 685], [601, 685]]}, {"text": "hasRs845.Howcanwe", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[1168, 644], [1477, 644], [1477, 671], [1168, 671]]}, {"text": "compare and tell which one", "conf": 0.846, "box": [[1165, 680], [1528, 678], [1529, 711], [1165, 713]]}, {"text": "Now find the percentage of marks Madiha got.", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[207, 720], [954, 722], [954, 762], [206, 760]]}, {"text": "is greater?", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[1163, 719], [1303, 721], [1303, 753], [1163, 750]]}, {"text": "Total marks", "conf": 0.874, "box": [[209, 785], [397, 785], [397, 819], [209, 819]]}, {"text": " 50", "conf": 0.669, "box": [[633, 783], [695, 783], [695, 821], [633, 821]]}, {"text": "Marks obtained by Ali", "conf": 0.856, "box": [[208, 849], [567, 849], [567, 886], [208, 886]]}, {"text": "= 40", "conf": 0.712, "box": [[594, 844], [696, 844], [696, 886], [594, 886]]}, {"text": "40", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[654, 908], [705, 908], [705, 942], [654, 942]]}, {"text": "Marks obtained by Ali", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[206, 932], [564, 931], [564, 968], [207, 969]]}, {"text": "156", "conf": 0.68, "box": [[642, 941], [709, 938], [711, 981], [644, 984]]}, {"text": "×100%", "conf": 0.671, "box": [[689, 933], [831, 924], [834, 961], [691, 970]]}, {"text": "= 80%", "conf": 0.774, "box": [[597, 1014], [721, 1014], [721, 1055], [597, 1055]]}, {"text": "So, by looking at the percentage of their marks, we can see that Ali got 6% more marks", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[202, 1087], [1573, 1075], [1574, 1115], [203, 1127]]}, {"text": "than Madiha.", "conf": 0.835, "box": [[203, 1143], [422, 1141], [422, 1176], [204, 1177]]}, {"text": "Example 2:", "conf": 0.841, "box": [[198, 1200], [394, 1197], [394, 1238], [199, 1241]]}, {"text": "Ahmad saved Rs 1600. He gave Rs 400 to some needy person. Saad has Rs 1200 and", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[197, 1285], [1611, 1265], [1612, 1305], [198, 1325]]}, {"text": "he gave Rs 624 to some needy person. Compare and tell who gave more percentage", "conf": 0.935, "box": [[195, 1334], [1602, 1319], [1603, 1363], [196, 1377]]}, {"text": "of his saving to the needy persons.", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[197, 1393], [795, 1381], [796, 1418], [198, 1430]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[195, 1457], [360, 1453], [361, 1488], [196, 1491]]}, {"text": "By observing this we can see that we cannot compare these quantities simply as we compare", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[193, 1497], [1611, 1477], [1612, 1534], [194, 1553]]}, {"text": "the whole numbers because the total amounts are different. So, here we will use percentage", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[192, 1550], [1597, 1534], [1598, 1587], [193, 1603]]}, {"text": "Ahmad's savings", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[200, 1679], [476, 1671], [477, 1711], [201, 1719]]}, {"text": "= Rs 1600", "conf": 0.798, "box": [[627, 1673], [800, 1668], [801, 1706], [628, 1710]]}, {"text": "He gave to needy persons = Rs 400", "conf": 0.864, "box": [[194, 1767], [783, 1743], [784, 1782], [196, 1806]]}, {"text": "400", "conf": 0.748, "box": [[967, 1803], [1035, 1803], [1035, 1839], [967, 1839]]}, {"text": "× 100%", "conf": 0.813, "box": [[1049, 1825], [1167, 1828], [1166, 1863], [1048, 1860]]}, {"text": "Percentage of money given to needy persons", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[193, 1847], [927, 1823], [929, 1866], [194, 1890]]}, {"text": "1600", "conf": 0.799, "box": [[961, 1842], [1042, 1842], [1042, 1878], [961, 1878]]}, {"text": "= 25%", "conf": 0.755, "box": [[928, 1909], [1040, 1912], [1039, 1950], [927, 1947]]}, {"text": "77", "conf": 0.665, "box": [[885, 1995], [932, 1995], [932, 2031], [885, 2031]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[280, 2018], [572, 1998], [574, 2031], [282, 2051]]}]}